# EXAMPLE ONLY - not installed, not active.
#
# How Boswas OS devices will consume the Boswas APT repository once it exists
# (docs/architecture/update-architecture.md). The channel component follows
# CHANNEL in /etc/boswas/update.conf (dev | qa | stable).
#
# The keyring will be shipped by a future boswas-archive-keyring package and
# contains ONLY the public repository signing key. Private signing keys are
# never stored in this repository.
#
# Types: deb
# URIs: https://repo.boswas.invalid/boswas-os
# Suites: trixie
# Components: stable
# Signed-By: /usr/share/keyrings/boswas-archive-keyring.pgp
